WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:34.330 --> 00:01:36.450
Help me! Please, help me!

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:38.190
I'm begging you! Please!

00:01:40.730 --> 00:01:42.040
Please, help me!

00:01:42.490 --> 00:01:44.180
Help me!

00:01:45.010 --> 00:01:46.960
It's been years, Kai-kun.

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:50.210
I see that you've remembered it all.

00:01:51.180 --> 00:01:52.110
Yes.

00:01:53.310 --> 00:01:54.260
It's me.

00:01:56.430 --> 00:01:57.170
I...

00:01:58.460 --> 00:02:00.060
I used to...

00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:02.230
live here!

00:02:02.410 --> 00:02:04.510
Yes... Kai Hiwatari.

00:02:04.670 --> 00:02:06.860
You were raised here.

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:08.970
Welcome home.

00:02:09.150 --> 00:02:11.950
Now, come with me.

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:13.780
Come with Volkov!

00:02:14.430 --> 00:02:15.230
With you?

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:17.740
Yes. You see, I...

00:02:18.230 --> 00:02:21.120
Your power is vital to my mission.

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:23.000
Come along, Kai-kun.

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:28.910
No.

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:30.170
Kai...!

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:32.460
You're right. I <i>do</i> remember this place.

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:34.670
And your face, as well.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:38.880
But... my memory's still foggy.

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:39.480
Come again?

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:42.750
Even if you're telling the truth,

00:02:43.170 --> 00:02:45.250
I don't plan on playing along with you.

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:46.920
Above all else,

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:50.900
I hate being asked for favors!

00:02:54.070 --> 00:02:55.500
A shame.

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:58.080
I hoped we could proceed quietly.

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:05.100
One Who Desires the Strongest

00:03:07.780 --> 00:03:09.950
I really used to be here.

00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:11.920
I remember these hallways.

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:19.180
So the exit would be down...

00:03:20.410 --> 00:03:21.140
this way!

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:23.220
Hold it right there, Kai-kun.

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:27.920
You have no choice but to
let me make use of your power.

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:30.080
It's for the sake of Borg, our organization!

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:31.270
Borg?

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:34.170
Yes, that's the group's name.

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:36.030
You saw it earlier, I believe?

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:38.780
We're developing the ultimate Bey.

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:43.740
That's why we're breeding children
to become the ultimate Bladers.

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:48.140
Making use of them and their Beys,
we plan to take over the world!

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:51.500
<i>That</i> is the goal of Borg.

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:54.680
Sounds like it has nothing to do with me.

00:03:54.890 --> 00:03:56.600
Just what I thought you'd say.

00:03:56.900 --> 00:03:59.380
Then how about this, Kai?

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:01.010
We'll make a deal.

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:02.510
A deal?

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:04.040
Yes, a deal.

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:08.900
Join us, and I will grant you
a wish, no matter what it is!

00:04:10.010 --> 00:04:10.930
A wish?

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:13.250
It doesn't matter what it is.

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:16.680
With my organization's power,
I can give you anything in the world.

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:25.620
What's so funny?

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:27.660
You bastards wouldn't be able to grant me that.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:28.090
What?

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:30.320
I have but one wish.

00:04:31.960 --> 00:04:34.480
To become an even stronger Blader!

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:35.930
Stronger?

00:04:35.930 --> 00:04:38.030
If you were to make use of our facilities...

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:40.000
Cut the crap, now.

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:42.800
I already took a peek at your setup.

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:46.550
None of that stuff would make me any stronger.

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:48.030
So let's face it—

00:04:48.670 --> 00:04:52.050
I'd be better off staying with
those BBA kids, wouldn't I?

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:53.560
Kai.

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:56.670
I'm done with hearing you out.

00:05:01.880 --> 00:05:03.200
Swapping monitors.

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:05.910
To become stronger, hmm?

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:08.690
His attitude hasn't changed.

00:05:09.310 --> 00:05:11.330
Which way is the kid running?

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:12.720
Pathway 113.

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:16.030
Activate our security system.

00:05:16.030 --> 00:05:17.400
I have an idea.

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:18.050
Roger.

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:21.730
You can't get any stronger here?

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:23.580
Nonsense!

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:27.940
I'll show you just how
mistaken you are, Kai-kun!

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:32.900
Is Kai gonna come back?

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:37.840
We haven't seen him since before our
battle with the Chinese Team and the PPB...

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:39.610
Wherever could he be?

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:42.140
Well, do we really gotta worry about him?

00:05:43.960 --> 00:05:46.560
He always runs off somewhere.

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:48.960
"You're all too soft."

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:53.250
He'd say something like that and leave.

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:54.520
Makes you wonder...

00:05:54.740 --> 00:05:56.630
Is he really the same as always?

00:05:56.820 --> 00:05:58.140
What do you mean?

00:05:58.910 --> 00:06:01.410
He's been acting strange since we got to Russia.

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:04.330
Especially after we went to that abbey.

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:05.900
Come to think of it...

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:07.050
Good point.

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:10.020
With his expression earlier...

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:13.300
Something has to be off.
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:06:14.660 --> 00:06:16.730
I'm going to go look for Kai.

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:19.050
In the middle of the night?

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:21.250
Yeah.

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:23.430
You guys can take it easy.

00:06:23.430 --> 00:06:26.650
Takao could be right in saying not to worry.

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:28.600
Guess there's no other choice.

00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:34.290
With the way you put it,
I got a little worried, myself.

00:06:34.650 --> 00:06:35.450
Takao!

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:39.130
Kai's our friend, after all.

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:41.040
We can't leave him alone.

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:42.940
Which means I'm going, too.

00:06:43.050 --> 00:06:44.650
That said, so will I!

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:46.220
Where should we be looking?

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:47.970
Let's start back there!

00:06:55.130 --> 00:06:56.000
Proceed!

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:56.370
Sir!

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:00.610
Lasers?!

00:07:13.080 --> 00:07:15.200
He has made it to Pathway 256.

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:16.720
Right on time.

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:21.380
What's this?

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:26.860
What you see before you are training
devices, used in Blader development.

00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:28.270
Training devices?

00:07:28.270 --> 00:07:31.220
This path was laid out with the devices in mind.

00:07:31.570 --> 00:07:34.310
Several of these training
devices have been prepared.

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:37.940
There was once a time where
even you aspired to train here.

00:07:38.910 --> 00:07:42.440
So you directed me here by firing lasers..?

00:07:42.740 --> 00:07:46.380
This isn't a path that you can
traverse with superficial skill.

00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:50.190
This should provide more
of a challenge than the labs did.

00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:55.370
Not to mention that you'll never
reach the exit if you can't get past this!

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:56.950
What a cheap trick.

00:07:58.460 --> 00:07:59.410
Have at me.

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:04.960
See for yourself...

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:06.180
how strong I am!

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:12.990
Dranzer!!

00:08:29.640 --> 00:08:30.690
What now?

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:31.720
We have intruders.

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:32.200
What?!

00:08:35.690 --> 00:08:37.060
It's those kids..!

00:08:37.920 --> 00:08:40.090
They have infrared surveillance equipment!

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:44.030
A bit excessive to fend off mere burglars...

00:08:44.030 --> 00:08:44.820
Clearly...

00:08:45.390 --> 00:08:47.570
This is more than just an abbey!

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:53.970
Takao, that building!

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:55.560
Kai showed interest in it!

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:57.540
Right, let's go!

00:08:58.040 --> 00:09:00.220
Ah! Wait for me!

00:09:01.420 --> 00:09:03.540
We can't let them inside.

00:09:03.820 --> 00:09:06.320
Don't let them any closer. Understood?

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:06.960
Yes.

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:09.020
Mr. Volkov, Kai has—

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:10.800
—done them in.

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:12.370
Kai has defeated them all!

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:18.930
It's all according to plan!

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:21.330
The real challenge lies further ahead.

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:27.710
I beat every single one of Borg's Beys.

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:28.880
Right...

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:32.180
I should have pulled it off flawlessly.

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:34.090
Even so—

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:38.980
What's with this feeling of
dissatisfaction, welling up inside me?

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:40.520
Even stronger.

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:43.440
I want to crush the perfect Bey!

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:46.350
I must be strong enough to destroy that Bey!

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:52.010
But I'm already perfect as-is...

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:53.480
There's no doubt about it.

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:54.820
I'm strong enough...

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:58.300
the way I am now!

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:05.660
As calculated.

00:10:06.100 --> 00:10:09.390
He's chasing memories of his former self.

00:10:09.680 --> 00:10:12.010
And when he does remember...

00:10:12.010 --> 00:10:14.230
he will belong to Borg!

00:10:27.630 --> 00:10:28.810
Almost there!

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:29.870
Let's go straight in!

00:10:37.180 --> 00:10:38.430
W-Who are you?!

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:41.260
Are you the intruders?

00:10:41.260 --> 00:10:43.140
How disgraceful.

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:44.990
I suggest that you leave immediately.

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:47.630
Beat it. We can't let you go any further.

00:10:48.800 --> 00:10:50.090
And if we don't?

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:51.330
What's that?

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:54.710
One of our teammates could be inside.

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:56.350
We can't just pack up and go home!

00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:58.120
So stubborn.

00:10:58.120 --> 00:11:00.150
If you wish to proceed,

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:02.440
you'll have to beat me, first.

00:11:03.440 --> 00:11:06.040
A Bey battle, huh? Sounds fun.

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:06.990
Takao!

00:11:06.990 --> 00:11:09.290
I think they'll let us go if we win!

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:11.100
So I'll win, just you watch!

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:13.770
Then we can find Kai.

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:16.040
Here we go!

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:18.120
Go... Shoot!

00:11:29.030 --> 00:11:30.470
Go, Dragoon!

00:11:39.350 --> 00:11:43.850
Don't make light of me!
Lest this be enough to take <i>me</i> down!

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:53.060
The more I fight, the more frustrated I feel...

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:03.730
Get even stronger!

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:05.930
Become more perfect!

00:12:06.540 --> 00:12:08.290
Until no flaws remain!

00:12:09.280 --> 00:12:10.220
Dang it!

00:12:10.350 --> 00:12:11.920
If I keep fighting like this...

00:12:12.900 --> 00:12:14.760
Why am I not satisfied?!

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:19.250
Dranzer and I should have fought a perfect battle!

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:22.620
No, I'm not perfect.

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:24.840
With Dranzer's current ability,

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:27.290
I can't keep fighting...

00:12:28.410 --> 00:12:29.280
Not like this!

00:12:29.610 --> 00:12:31.730
Dranzer is not up to par.

00:12:31.900 --> 00:12:33.120
Volkov!

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:36.770
I understand how you feel.

00:12:37.090 --> 00:12:39.920
You want to be stronger—more perfect!

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:42.020
That's what you're thinking, yes?

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:44.190
It's only natural.

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:48.300
Back when you trained here,

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:50.710
you always felt that way!

00:12:50.710 --> 00:12:51.410
What?!

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:54.050
You began to feel dissatisfied...

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:58.470
Once you found a way to become even stronger!

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:01.940
Become even stronger?

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:06.440
Come with me. You'll find an answer there.

00:13:12.030 --> 00:13:17.400
What's the matter?
Did you remember how strong you could be?

00:13:32.320 --> 00:13:32.990
You're mine!

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:39.810
Takao! You've got to finish this, quickly!

00:13:39.810 --> 00:13:41.240
I got it!

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:45.050
At a glance, this battle looks close, but...

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:47.180
That Bey is far from ordinary!

00:13:47.710 --> 00:13:49.840
Rei, please take a look!

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:53.110
This is the data that came back
after analyzing its movement.

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:54.350
This is...

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:57.600
Its quick movements are comparable to Dragoon's,

00:13:57.600 --> 00:13:59.040
and its attack power...

00:13:59.040 --> 00:14:01.300
Might even surpass Driger?!

00:14:05.090 --> 00:14:06.360
The BBA, huh?

00:14:06.920 --> 00:14:10.190
I'm not surprised you made it all
the way to the World Championships.

00:14:10.400 --> 00:14:13.490
Still, I'm not even using half of my true power.

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:15.360
No need to get serious.

00:14:15.570 --> 00:14:20.300
Our mission is to stop them in a battle.

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:23.330
Collect data on them in the process.

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:25.440
Got it?

00:14:25.440 --> 00:14:26.290
Leave it to me.

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:28.300
Wyborg, play around with him!

00:14:31.650 --> 00:14:33.960
Takao, you need to finish this, fast!

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:34.690
I said I know!

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:39.180
Kai...

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:45.340
The secret to making you stronger lies in here!

00:14:45.870 --> 00:14:46.820
Behold!

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:51.150
This is...

00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:52.700
This Bey is...

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:57.420
Black Dranzer!

00:14:57.690 --> 00:15:00.380
Indeed! Borg's ultimate Bey!

00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:01.630
Black Dranzer!

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:02.880
That's it...

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:05.310
I remember now.

00:15:06.390 --> 00:15:09.960
During my time here, I always lusted after it...

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:11.580
Yes...

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:16.380
Ever since I saw it battle in an
experimental facility gathering data.

00:15:18.880 --> 00:15:21.510
Three, two, one...

00:15:21.780 --> 00:15:22.680
Shoot.

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:41.220
Perfect attack.

00:15:41.220 --> 00:15:42.560
Perfect speed.

00:15:42.560 --> 00:15:44.330
And perfect destructive force.

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:46.530
It was a true Beyblade.

00:15:46.530 --> 00:15:48.690
One with true strength!

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:53.420
From then on, I began to grow
dissatisfied during my daily drills.

00:15:54.030 --> 00:15:57.230
If I had that Bey, I knew
I could fight more flawlessly!

00:15:58.080 --> 00:16:00.080
It was a chance to get stronger!

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:02.800
That's what I wanted.

00:16:03.950 --> 00:16:07.950
But in the end, you couldn't
get your hands on Black Dranzer.

00:16:09.420 --> 00:16:11.550
For it was no ordinary Bey.

00:16:14.120 --> 00:16:16.550
After being told it wasn't your typical Bey,

00:16:16.550 --> 00:16:19.780
we were barred from getting anywhere near it.

00:16:22.940 --> 00:16:24.630
But I couldn't help myself.

00:16:26.240 --> 00:16:29.230
With this Bey, I'll get lots stronger!

00:16:29.560 --> 00:16:30.760
Go!

00:16:43.220 --> 00:16:44.770
And its creator?

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:49.020
A historical figure that plunged
the Russian Empire into the depths of chaos.

00:16:50.020 --> 00:16:51.570
The evil monk, Rasputin.

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:56.720
Using a secret alchemic method,
that man developed this Bey.

00:16:56.720 --> 00:17:00.040
For that reason, it can't be easily controlled.

00:17:01.180 --> 00:17:05.680
What happened back then was the Bey's
energy reacting to your emotional strength,

00:17:05.680 --> 00:17:07.580
causing it to spin out of control.

00:17:08.240 --> 00:17:13.510
Resulting from that, you lost your memories.

00:17:16.140 --> 00:17:22.060
At the time, there wasn't anyone
in the world who could control it.

00:17:22.780 --> 00:17:23.800
However,

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:27.120
the way you are now,

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:28.690
you may be able to use it.

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:30.070
What?!

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:35.740
A strong body and unrelenting will
are what's vital to controlling it.

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:39.910
Having seen the way you fight here,

00:17:40.900 --> 00:17:42.780
you likely have what it takes.

00:17:43.840 --> 00:17:46.410
I think you'd be able to use it.

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:48.050
If that happens, you'll be...

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:51.110
the greatest Blader known to man!

00:17:51.900 --> 00:17:53.310
So, what's the catch?

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:57.170
You're just handing me your precious Bey.

00:17:58.470 --> 00:17:59.560
I doubt it's free.

00:18:00.580 --> 00:18:01.880
It's nothing major.

00:18:02.380 --> 00:18:04.530
So long as you return to Borg,

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:06.610
the Bey is yours to keep.

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:08.990
You seem confused.

00:18:09.340 --> 00:18:10.290
Don't tell me...

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:13.090
you still feel something for the BBA?

00:18:13.090 --> 00:18:14.220
What'd you say?!

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:17.030
You still feel their comradery, yes?

00:18:17.740 --> 00:18:19.010
But, you see,

00:18:19.010 --> 00:18:20.620
they can't grant your wish!

00:18:20.850 --> 00:18:24.080
All that can do so is Black Dranzer!

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:26.260
Now, Kai-kun! You needn't hesitate.

00:18:27.570 --> 00:18:29.200
I don't like your tone.

00:18:29.200 --> 00:18:29.770
Kai-kun!

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:35.610
Your Borg collective uses a Bey as bait,
and you still wonder if I feel for the BBA?

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:39.270
I don't like the way you think! Not one bit.

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:43.860
Even if I'm to crush that uneasiness,

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:46.300
the fact remains...

00:18:48.360 --> 00:18:49.680
This Bey is...

00:18:54.810 --> 00:18:57.940
I'll play a part in your plan.

00:18:58.340 --> 00:18:59.560
Release these chains!

00:19:04.050 --> 00:19:05.560
Roger that.

00:19:05.560 --> 00:19:06.560
Wrap things up.

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:12.380
Hey! We're not done yet!

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:14.320
We got word just now.

00:19:14.720 --> 00:19:17.880
You're searching for a boy named Kai, correct?

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:19.880
How did you know that?

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:23.690
He was just found back behind the Abbey.

00:19:24.520 --> 00:19:27.860
Still, he has a fever, and may have caught a cold.

00:19:28.110 --> 00:19:29.080
A fever?

00:19:29.080 --> 00:19:30.490
So let us see!

00:19:30.650 --> 00:19:32.140
Not right now.

00:19:32.260 --> 00:19:35.270
We're in the middle of treating him.

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:37.820
While you won't be let inside,

00:19:38.040 --> 00:19:39.990
you do have our word.

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:43.620
You'll be able to see him
after we finish the treatment.

00:19:43.840 --> 00:19:44.960
For real?

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:46.830
What are your names?

00:19:47.220 --> 00:19:48.870
My name is Yuriy.

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:50.340
I'm Ivan.

00:19:50.570 --> 00:19:52.160
Yuriy. Ivan.

00:19:52.160 --> 00:19:54.340
You'll stick to your word, right?

00:19:54.560 --> 00:19:55.710
We will.

00:19:55.930 --> 00:19:56.950
Of course.

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:01.710
For the moment, we'll have to trust them.

00:20:01.710 --> 00:20:06.290
Not to mention how poorly
our trespassing reflects on us...

00:20:06.290 --> 00:20:09.610
We should just hope they'll keep their promise.

00:20:10.580 --> 00:20:12.440
I don't care what you say!

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:14.350
Kai...

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:17.620
Are you really okay?

00:20:21.940 --> 00:20:23.460
He has returned to Borg.

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:30.240
In the past, Kai-kun struggled with
memory loss after bringing him here,

00:20:30.240 --> 00:20:33.840
but I believe he will finally
get to play his proper role,

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:35.880
Mr. Hiwatari.

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:40.200
His role in collecting the power of many Beys...

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:43.000
I wonder how far he'll go

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:45.520
in order to make my dreams a reality.

00:20:46.580 --> 00:20:48.650
My grandson, Kai...

00:21:09.670 --> 00:21:11.710
This time, I'll be able to control it.

00:21:12.900 --> 00:21:14.910
Even while holding it,

00:21:14.910 --> 00:21:17.840
I can feel the Bey's power flow into me.

00:21:19.280 --> 00:21:21.520
This is true strength.

00:21:22.090 --> 00:21:23.790
My fate's been decided.

00:21:24.410 --> 00:21:26.520
I shall advance with this in hand...

00:21:26.740 --> 00:21:30.280
even if the path is stained with blood.

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:57.400 --> 00:23:02.530
According to my analysis, the secretive
Russian team is nothing to sneeze at!

00:23:02.530 --> 00:23:07.520
But, a side-match is being held by Mr. Volkov!

00:23:07.520 --> 00:23:10.400
We can finally see Russia's representatives in action!

00:23:10.400 --> 00:23:13.040
First up is the PPB's match, but,

00:23:13.040 --> 00:23:15.920
But, to our shock, the one to come out...

00:23:15.920 --> 00:23:18.400
is Kai, with a mean look on his face!

00:23:18.400 --> 00:23:21.000
Next time: The Fiendish Ceremony Match!

00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:24.940
Kai, did you become a Russian?!
